  "reference": "1 Damanyoojiga 22",
  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayi Dawdi, “Hiji heechea ghoah gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA ak ea nukwa heeda wagiida sigwariideaysa haleanjeeda ghadooweeda aba Israeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giidiing'deayda deesta gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanung' Dawdi ghabwat geat rabasta mida jeeda ng'eanyiida Israeli, ak gageanu fuga jea gwasin lagheanga ghwadeas gheeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin Dawdi heeda adiiwa gharinga saang'a ea musumaarajeega ea gharinga sirata gidaghuudajeega ea waayajeega ea gharinga oomng'i saang'a meemu eeteen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea beehajeega gubooyeeka, manda mooneeda, aba gideaba fuga Sidoni ea fuga Diro gweadu heeda Dawdi beehajeega gubooyeeka manda mooneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwayi Dawdi, “Orjeedeanyu was Sulemani gudea mwanang' ak ea mii ghwanyas fughareeda, nea gheeda jea eedeeksa NG'UTAMIIDA gajea miy muuchi, nea ghaloamwaat ak ea ghaambiidaat aba darooraka sean, asi gaydeadiing'da aba deesta.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaguursa orjeedaanyi, was Sulemani, ak gwayeesha deas gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Dawdi ak gwayeesha Sulemani, “Orjeedeanyu, ghayi geagasayi aba gurooroodeanyu dadeas gheeda nea geasisi mureeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYU. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwahidu ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA heedeanyu, ak gwayi, ‘Ang'iing'i niihiidi foojeanda saang'a ak ea ning'uchi ng'ucheadinga hees, maydeasa gheeda aba gheawungeasu, aba gideaba niihiidi foojeanda saang'a aba madeedeanyu aba badayda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula, gayjiila baleanda, ak niny gajea siida hoyyoo. Ak gaydaadaw niny hoyyoo aba heeda weajoodigaaschi sean neaweesa, ak gajeeguura gheawungaaschi Sulemani, ak gaydaadaw hoyyoo ea hawdeayda Israeli aba eaweagaachi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niny gayghwadeas gheeda aba gheawungeasu. Ak gayghoah orjeedeanyu, ak gaydoaw ghwaan, ak gaydeamajeek hoorgeadaanyi bea gheambalmeeda aba jeeda Israeli damanda manda muudeanooda.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa, orjeedeanyu, gagasa mideawana NG'UTAMIIDA, ak giimuusi deasa gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, gawuurji gidaghayi rukuteayda aba badaydaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagasa gagoonyi NG'UTAMIIDA weaghuumeeda ea fughareeda, ak giimbali Israeli ak giing'waanyi diigheanda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaymiyeena iing'waanyi muuchi diigheanyeeka ea deaweedajeega ghayi adaw NG'UTAMIIDA Musa aba badayda Israeli. Majeegiida, nea gimwaanyiidi. Adibeali, nea adihirbabani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba sawanadeeda haw neadiiwji aba badayda NG'UTAMIIDA dalaantaji sagalamnyooji bughala bea dahaabu, ea dalaantaji sagalam niba sagalama bea lapiya, oomng'i ea gharinga manda mooneeda, aba gideaba aasaang'a ea beehajeega ea lagheanga earaga neadiiwji. Ak eara ang'iing'i abeeda giihaadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ang'iing'i gindeawi buuneesaang'a bea gadiyeeda. Fuga sina lagheanga, ea fuga deekshachi, ea fuga beara beehajeega, ea heeluutka saang'a bea fuga was gearnoodiga manda mooneeda, nea ghoamu gagadiiy muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba sinooda dahaabu, ea lapiya, ea lagheanga oomng'i ea gharinga. Asi ng'eada ak gigadiiyi! Nea gagasa mideawana NG'UTAMIIDA!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Dawdi fuga hees sean bea Israeli gideaba aweada Sulemani was orjeedaanyi nea gooyeeshi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Neada NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U ea mindeawani? Ak ea mii gagoonyi hoyyoo aba meadajeega seani? Aba gideaba niyiin fuga bea ng'eanyiida geatingeasu, ak ghamneawa ng'eanyiida ea nibeal aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA sea fugaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa nung' gagal fughareadaang'u ea gurooroadaang'u gassooda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U. Asi ng'eada ak gideasi heeda ghaydit bea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ak abeeda sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA ea dabita ghaydidi bea ASEETA gajeeyeadu jeeda gheeda sideas aba gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
